1
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:18,880
I've thought of a way

2
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:20,760
to protect myself

3
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,280
and protect her.

4
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:23,039
Her?

5
00:01:23,320 --> 00:01:23,850
Bai Weng,

6
00:01:24,039 --> 00:01:25,840
Fenghuang Police Station is hiring.

7
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:26,760
Pull some strings

8
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:27,560
and sign me up.

9
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:29,160
You want to be a police officer?

10
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:30,400
I must find out why

11
00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:32,170
our brothers went missing.

12
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:33,400
And

13
00:01:33,759 --> 00:01:34,960
my father's death.

14
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,640
The boss said back then

15
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:38,039
that you are not allowed to seek revenge.

16
00:01:38,039 --> 00:01:39,759
Being a police officer makes it easier to act.

17
00:01:39,759 --> 00:01:40,440
Besides,

18
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:42,300
I can carry a gun justifiably.

19
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:43,640
Let me do it.

20
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,330
Otherwise, I won't be able to eat or sleep.

21
00:01:58,160 --> 00:01:59,000
You're awake.

22
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,800
Peter, let me go.

23
00:02:00,880 --> 00:02:01,540
Miss Jiang.

24
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:04,040
You brought this upon yourself.

25
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:04,840
You.

26
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:11,840
You saw it.

27
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:14,400
Stop.

28
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,020
Don't cry out loud.

29
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,880
I hate noise the most.

30
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:20,130
Otherwise, you'll end up like him.

31
00:02:20,480 --> 00:02:21,240
Understand?

32
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:26,280
You actually used these boys and girls for experiments.

33
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:28,360
You are a heartless beast.

34
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:30,640
They were all homeless,

35
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:31,640
pitiful people.

36
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:33,600
Don't worry.

37
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:36,610
I let them eat their fill before they died.

38
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:39,250
You are different, Miss Jiang.

39
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:42,160
You have a perfect face

40
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:45,000
and a pair of perfect eyes.

41
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:49,200
Get lost, you filthy foreigner!

42
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,260
Senior Sister.

43
00:02:58,720 --> 00:02:59,720
Stop hitting him.

44
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:00,920
If you keep hitting him, we won't get anything out of him.

45
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:01,320
Siyao.

46
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:02,290
Are you okay?

47
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:09,530
Don't be afraid. We are the police.

48
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:10,970
Don't be afraid.

49
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:13,570
You should be glad you didn't do anything.

50
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:15,840
Otherwise, I would have crippled you.

51
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:18,800
Peter,

52
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:21,040
we now have evidence proving

53
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:22,000
that you smuggled illegal drugs

54
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,160
and raped women.

55
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,360
Do you plead guilty?

56
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:25,890
What are you talking about?

57
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:27,090
I don't understand.

58
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,800
What the hell is he saying?

59
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,680
What is he babbling about?

60
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,000
How am I supposed to record this?

61
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:32,480
Go

62
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:34,460
and call Ye Shian over.

63
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,200
He's not a police officer.

64
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:37,480
He can't interrogate suspects.

65
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:39,200
Let him be a temporary translator.

66
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:41,860
There are precedents for special cases, right?

67
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:45,329
You don't understand Chinese either.

68
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:08,680
Let me ask you.

69
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,800
That tattoo on your chest,

70
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:11,800
what does it mean?

71
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,520
Speak English.

72
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:15,560
If you don't explain it clearly,

73
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:17,660
do you think you can really leave?

74
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,930
Before the concession police arrive,

75
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,920
I won't say a word.

76
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:23,460
No one can protect you.

77
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,520
Try me.

78
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,440
I will be out soon.

79
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,200
Peter,

80
00:04:28,440 --> 00:04:29,360
this is China.

81
00:04:29,640 --> 00:04:30,280
China.

82
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:34,200
It is exactly because I am in China

83
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:36,120
that I can do whatever I want

84
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:37,880
without being punished.

85
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,280
Don't forget,

86
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:41,840
I am a citizen of the British Empire

87
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:44,680
and enjoy extraterritorial rights here.

88
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:47,480
Your country is backward and weak.

89
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:51,400
I will not be judged by Chinese law.

90
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:57,800
Why are you here?

91
00:04:58,440 --> 00:04:59,700
English translation.

92
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:02,640
People from the British Concession Police Station are here.

93
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,800
They want to extradite Peter to the station.

94
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:05,800
That's enough.

95
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:13,200
Exactly.

96
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:16,480
You might be immune to Chinese law.

97
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:18,930
But as for this beating from a Chinese,

98
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:21,200
you have to take it.

99
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:23,080
What are you doing?

100
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:26,800
Police beating a foreign citizen will incur diplomatic consequences.

101
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:28,480
What a coincidence.

102
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:30,200
I am not a police officer.

103
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:31,200
I...

104
00:05:41,760 --> 00:05:43,840
Hello, I am the inspector of the Phoenix Police Department,

105
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:44,570
Jiang Siyao.

106
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:47,280
I am the Chinese inspector of the British Concession Police Station,

107
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:48,159
Zhou Wei.

108
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:51,400
Inspector Zhou, what brings you to my police station?

109
00:05:51,400 --> 00:05:53,480
Under the orders of Chief Inspector Zhu,

110
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,200
I am here

111
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:56,440
to extradite the suspect, a doctor at St. George's Hospital,

112
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:57,240
Richard Pitt,

113
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:58,930
back to the police station.

114
00:05:59,000 --> 00:05:59,640
I'm sorry.

115
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:02,040
Pitt is suspected of a serious crime.

116
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,680
He is currently under our investigation,

117
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:05,200
so we cannot hand him over to you.

118
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:06,200
Inspector Jiang,

119
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,280
you know

120
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,680
he is protected by consular jurisdiction.

121
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:12,000
The Chinese side has no right to detain or interrogate him.

122
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:12,930
Inspector Zhou,

123
00:06:13,440 --> 00:06:14,570
Pitt is a foreigner,

124
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:17,370
but the victims are our Chinese children.

125
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:19,280
I will definitely investigate this thoroughly.

126
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:20,740
I understand how you feel,

127
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:23,000
but I must execute this procedure.

128
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:24,080
Zhou Wei,

129
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:26,440
doing dirty work for foreigners,

130
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:28,600
aren't you afraid of divine retribution?

131
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:30,040
Look who it is.

132
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:33,000
It's our little foreign girl.

133
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:35,440
It seems your pretending to be a foreign mistress that day

134
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:36,970
was for the investigation.

135
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,040
As for interfering with the justice of the case,

136
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:41,040
I'll settle the score with you next time.

137
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:43,040
I'll be waiting for you to settle it.

138
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:44,080
Inspector Jiang,

139
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:45,360
I don't want to make things difficult for you,

140
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,440
so don't make things difficult for me.

141
00:06:46,440 --> 00:06:47,000
I won't let him go.

142
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:47,400
You...

143
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:51,560
Let him go.

144
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,800
Mayor Zeng called.

145
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:56,080
This is his order.

146
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:08,730
Doesn't your stomach hurt?

147
00:07:10,200 --> 00:07:10,880
Yes.

148
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:13,520
My stomach hurts.

149
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,480
It's been hurting all day.

150
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,400
If you hadn't come, I would have died of pain.

151
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:19,330
Take him to the hospital and keep a close watch on him.

152
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,730
Superintendent Li.

153
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:37,480
Did you know something happened to Peter?

154
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:40,680
He's been transferred to the Concession Police Station.

155
00:07:40,960 --> 00:07:42,240
He's British.

156
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:43,600
So they can't convict him.

157
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:45,640
At a critical time like this,

158
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:48,770
you're the only one with a solution, Superintendent Li.

159
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:50,240
England.

160
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:52,850
Direct from Tanggu Pier to Liverpool.

161
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:54,840
When the time comes,

162
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:56,500
you can reunite with your son.

163
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,600
At my age,

164
00:07:58,640 --> 00:08:00,640
I don't want to die in a foreign land.

165
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:02,200
How about this?

166
00:08:02,400 --> 00:08:03,440
In a couple of years,

167
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:04,640
when things blow over,

168
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:05,480
I'll come back.

169
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:07,800
I'll definitely be able to make a comeback.

170
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:10,260
Then I'll continue to show my respect to you.

171
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:14,240
Alright.

172
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,130
Superintendent Li.

173
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:25,840
Wait,

174
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:27,960
didn't you say we were taking a boat?

175
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:28,840
Where is the pier?

176
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:29,880
Are you crazy?

177
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:32,880
If I drive a police car to take you to the pier,

178
00:08:32,880 --> 00:08:34,679
wouldn't that let the whole world know

179
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:36,679
that I, Li Chengrui, let you escape?

180
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:41,200
Silly me.

181
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:44,760
Th-th-this is

182
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:47,800
for you to spend on the road.

183
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:50,440
Brother.

184
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:53,280
Words cannot express my gratitude.

185
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:57,000
Go through this forest.

186
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,530
Someone will meet you soon.

187
00:08:58,640 --> 00:08:59,400
Go.

188
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,040
Posing?

189
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:30,360
Did I look handsome just now?

190
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:31,400
Handsome my ass.

191
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:32,170
Give it to me.

192
00:09:36,160 --> 00:09:37,160
Ah my ass.

193
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:38,490
Take me to the hospital.

194
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:39,800
Okay, okay.

195
00:09:40,520 --> 00:09:41,120
Hurry.

196
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:44,080
Mr. Wang,

197
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:45,090
why are you here?

198
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:46,240
Lei Lie is dead.

199
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:47,360
When did this happen?

200
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:48,290
Just last night.

201
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,560
I examined the body.

202
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:50,690
The bullet in Lei Lie

203
00:09:50,760 --> 00:09:52,220
came from Yao Qiang's gun.

204
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,640
Where is Li Chengrui?

205
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:55,640
Li Chengrui said he went to the hospital.

206
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:56,400
Today's newspaper

207
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:57,880
reported the death of the Jiuhe Gang leader

208
00:09:57,880 --> 00:09:59,400
and suppressed the news about Peter.

209
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:00,840
Peter is still at large,

210
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:02,960
but the higher-ups issued an official document

211
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:04,440
requiring our Phoenix Police Department

212
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:08,440
to take responsibility for Lei Lie assaulting the police and escaping.

213
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:13,610
Zheng Kun was silenced.

214
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:16,000
Bai Xianming is dead and can't testify.

215
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:18,060
Lei Lie was killed resisting arrest.

216
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:19,960
Peter was deported.

217
00:10:21,160 --> 00:10:23,160
Is it the incompetence of the police,

218
00:10:23,160 --> 00:10:25,420
or are these pieces of evidence useless?

219
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:28,890
And now they want us to take responsibility for this.

220
00:10:35,640 --> 00:10:36,640
Inspector Jiang,

221
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:37,760
Where are you going?

222
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:39,600
We can't just let the matter with Peter go.

223
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:40,530
I'll go with you.

224
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:04,040
Are you comfortable?

225
00:11:04,880 --> 00:11:06,000
What do you think the Chinese police

226
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,000
can do to me?

227
00:11:08,400 --> 00:11:10,960
I can still have fun with Chinese women, can't I?
